[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0010","text":"……这里，好厉害啊\n这些攀爬架"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0020","text":"诶……啊，\n是运动设施吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0030","text":"这么结实的设施\n一般只有这种大公园才有呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0040","text":"……是这样啊\n我不太来过这种地方"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0060","text":"……那个，要不要爬上去试试\n像绳梯的那里"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0070","text":"诶……！？\n美、美琴小姐要爬吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0080","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_22500100_02_0090","text":"……一起爬吗？"}]
